        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"ec82573c-2098-4292-a17b-4690612181a1\",\"review_text\":\"Worst music app ever\"},{\"review_id\":\"446eea99-fb26-42cb-907a-91d924d4cdb1\",\"review_text\":\"you deserves 5 star but I gave you only 2 stars because when you started premium on your app it became worst.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b289ec28-1b12-4df2-a47b-7e2b6e73620e\",\"review_text\":\"Exceptional\"},{\"review_id\":\"cf247888-4dcc-4f49-a7a4-5158cfd2f63a\",\"review_text\":\"All d music u like\"},{\"review_id\":\"9fb86baa-0e5f-41a1-839e-d0126a11c40b\",\"review_text\":\"W app\"},{\"review_id\":\"c2774d59-69bf-43a7-bf0d-d49b240b33f1\",\"review_text\":\"After paying for premium for ~10 years, Spotify have released a new homepage, and it is utterly awful. Somewhere someone in Spotify has managed to persuade the Exec that the video app Tik-tok is very successful, so Spotify (the music app) should start pretending to be Tik-tok. Auto-playing music vids (out loud) is not cool. Big, glitchy, data-hungry tiles also not cool. All users are asking for is an on/off for the new homepage. Unless it changes, byebye Spotify premium, hello Tidal premium!\"},{\"review_id\":\"c52b4394-74af-4a88-9bd6-0d81dab33305\",\"review_text\":\"the app won't let me login with my number even though I'm entering the correct number please help\"},{\"review_id\":\"1035bd10-bfd2-4bca-a028-16d7c27242c5\",\"review_text\":\"Very excellent\"},{\"review_id\":\"59900c01-095e-4c15-85d1-65211a8d18af\",\"review_text\":\"It really the best app I have use\"},{\"review_id\":\"a599945b-530b-4237-9202-e46ac114a104\",\"review_text\":\"Good 👍\"}]}"
